# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ArchiveDrop API (Cloudflare Worker) — environment reference
#
# There are THREE places env values live. Each value lives in exactly ONE:
#
#  1. wrangler.jsonc "vars"      → non-secret config, committed to git
#  2. wrangler secret put <NAME> → production secrets (Workers runtime)
#  3. .dev.vars                  → the same secrets, for LOCAL DEV only (gitignored)
#
# DATABASE_URL is the exception: it is read from .env by drizzle-kit for
# migrations, and (optionally) by `wrangler dev` when no Hyperdrive binding
# is configured yet.
#
# This file is the full reference of every variable. Copy secrets to .dev.vars
# for local dev. Never commit .env or .dev.vars.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── 1. wrangler.jsonc "vars" (non-secret, committed) ─────────────────────────
# R2_BUCKET_NAME=archivedrop-media
# CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173            ← comma-separated; add your
#                                                 Pages domain for production

# ── 2. Secrets — `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>` (production) ────────────────
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-oauth-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
JWT_SECRET=generate-32+-random-chars
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...
R2_ACCOUNT_ID=your-cloudflare-account-id
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-r2-s3-api-token-id
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-r2-s3-api-token-secret

# Optional — override the Whisper model (default: whisper-large-v3-turbo)
# GROQ_MODEL=whisper-large-v3

# ── 3. Database — drizzle-kit migrations (+ optional local dev fallback) ─────
# Your REAL Postgres URL (Neon/Supabase/etc). Used by `npm run db:*`.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/archivedrop
